mediasynclite for Debian
-------------------------

MediaSync Lite installs a desktop entry (mediasynclite.desktop) and an
icon set under /usr/share/icons/hicolor, so it appears with its icon in
the application menu / dock of any freedesktop.org-compliant desktop
environment (GNOME, KDE, XFCE, etc.) after installation.

